{{also|speise|spéise}}
==German==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alter|de|Speis'|Speis}}

===Etymology===
From {{inh|de|gmh|spīse}}, {{inh|de|goh|spīsa}}; borrowed from {{bor|de|LL.|spēsa}}, Late Latin alternation of {{der|de|la|expēnsa}}, feminine of {{m|la|expēnsus}}, perfect passive participle of {{m|la|expendō}}, from {{af|la|ex-|pendō|nocat=1}}. Cognate with {{cog|it|spesa||expenditure, expenses}},<ref>{{R:Kluge 1891|Speise}}</ref> {{cog|da|spise}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|de|/ˈʃpaɪ̯zə/}}
